  "independent_findings": [
    "Current official Amulet1183 agrees with the local catalog: Earth Item0/own go again, with an Instant destroy cost and own attack-action power/defense increase for the turn; activation requires Earth fusion in that same turn. Existing native Earth-fusion legality gate and both buff operations are present, so this is not an implementation-absence claim.",
