    "CR8.3.17 defines Fusion as an optional additional reveal cost, and CR5.1.3/5.1.7-9 distinguish early declaration from actual effect-cost payment after asset payment. Actual reveal and earned fusion flags cannot be treated as merely selecting a cost parameter.",
    "Full selected ordinary play path GL968-991 creates pending resource/action payment and invokes PrepareCard before TryCompletePayment. Full RunSourceMacro1264-1297 has no selected Fusion override; suppressed-source and declared-reaction branches do not provide a selected Mulch deferred payment path. PreparedEffectCostSource333-357 excludes Mulch.",
    "Actual canonical and emitted Mulch continuation call FaBELEFinishFusion before FaBFinishPreparedCard. FinishFusion13-19 writes eleFuseEarth/FUSED_Earth and invokes actual FaBRevealChoices; FinishPrepared217-234 then reaches GL1101-1102 resource/AP debit. Thus the selected positive Earth producer inherits the known asset/effect-cost ordering dependency.",
    "The historical Glacial hold hash is verified only as the same-family planning reference at old9e984. It is Ice fusion, is not an Earth producer, and supplies no current native evidence. No alternate producer hunt or verdict about all possible Fusion routes was made."
  ],
